---
export const prerender = false;
import ProLegalDocument from '../components/ProLegalDocument.astro';
---

<ProLegalDocument
  title="Acceptable Use Policy"
  eyebrow="Use Pro responsibly"
  description="Content and behavior rules for the ImageToURL Pro image-hosting workspace."
  intro="Pro is for legitimate image storage and delivery. These rules protect users, rights holders, and shared infrastructure."
>
  <section>
    <h2>1. Rights to content</h2>
    <p>
      Upload only content you created, own, or are authorized to store and distribute. Do not infringe
      copyrights, trademarks, privacy, publicity, confidentiality, or other rights.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>2. Prohibited content</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Illegal content or material that facilitates illegal activity.</li>
      <li>Child sexual abuse material or any sexual exploitation or endangerment of children.</li>
      <li>Non-consensual intimate imagery, sexual extortion, or voyeuristic content.</li>
      <li>Credible threats, targeted harassment, or promotion of violence against people or protected groups.</li>
      <li>Malware, phishing, credential theft, malicious redirects, or deceptive downloads.</li>
      <li>Highly sensitive personal information disclosed without authorization.</li>
      <li>Fraudulent impersonation or content that infringes legal or intellectual-property rights.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>3. Prohibited behavior</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Evading delivery, upload, account, rate, or security controls.</li>
      <li>Automating undocumented endpoints or scraping private areas.</li>
      <li>Attacking security controls, disrupting service, or probing vulnerabilities without permission.</li>
      <li>Using links for spam, phishing, deceptive ads, resource exhaustion, or abusive traffic schemes.</li>
      <li>Reselling a personal workspace or operating a competing hosting service without written agreement.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>4. Enforcement and reports</h2>
    <p>
      We may restrict delivery, quarantine or remove content, and suspend or terminate access based on
      severity. Urgent threats and illegal content may be acted on without advance notice.
    </p>
    <p>
      Report abuse or infringement to
      <a href="mailto:blog.boopul@gmail.com?subject=ImageToURL%20Pro%20abuse%20report">blog.boopul@gmail.com</a>
      with the exact asset URL, reason, contact information, and supporting evidence.
    </p>
  </section>
</ProLegalDocument>
